/T (The GPU handles graphics such as images, 3D models and visual effects. For graphics-intensive design work, a suitable GPU can reduce the graphics workload placed on the CPU. The cooling system uses fans, heatsinks and thermal material to move heat away from the CPU and GPU.)
/E (The GPU handles graphics such as images, 3D models and visual effects. For graphics-intensive design work, a suitable GPU can reduce the graphics workload placed on the CPU. The cooling system uses fans, heatsinks and thermal material to move heat away from the CPU and GPU.)
